{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_05_003_00_5_05_003_00",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fdb08c7ce8be631b070052b25026f11bd2d01b84cfefa6feb660b90842a0a3f7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_05_003_00_5_05_003_00:5_05_003_00:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22ac77b28700a0b79526eb2a61f66b550d0afff145435b2cb7256d756afc837e",
      "text": "面向岁末联合演唱会",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_003_00_5_05_003_00:5_05_003_00:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbd0181cce6372975b3146f1bb4564824e314b85bc7d0ea9f0b6fd383e9f78d7",
      "text": "辉、北斗、类三人接到制作人的\n联络后，聚集到了事务所。\n他们在那里得知，自己将作为315 Production的代表，\n出席与其他事务所共同举办的联合演唱会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_003_00_5_05_003_00:5_05_003_00:cmd-000020:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3bd4b94ccc07076bcf1055f6b600e5c9372f0c31cff6d08c458f7cc3eed545f",
      "text": "FES",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_003_00_5_05_003_00:5_05_003_00:cmd-000020:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22ac77b28700a0b79526eb2a61f66b550d0afff145435b2cb7256d756afc837e",
      "text": "面向岁末联合演唱会",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_003_00_5_05_003_00:5_05_003_00:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52c6ffbc37da2836626dd94ddc105d95c03368d2052b9e5e221958372e11d84d",
      "text": "辛苦啦。我泡了热饮过来。\n咱们边喝边开会吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_003_00_5_05_003_00:5_05_003_00:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7e8266a78304c6acc523897738228ba5aeafedf9dbc31f8042cd8b7897ef1e8",
      "text": "谢谢您！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_003_00_5_05_003_00:5_05_003_00:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1da96a73d901d35eb5ab8870a4c72dcf8e06904d7d34342718d820e4451086e",
      "text": "Thank you very much☆ 闻起来很香的，\n原来是这个啊。嗯～，好喝！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_003_00_5_05_003_00:5_05_003_00:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2300a5b05c877df258cecebb3436e47c8c82cad2c6c373561de83c853dca4cf1",
      "text": "非常感谢，天道先生。\n收拾整理就交给我吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_003_00_5_05_003_00:5_05_003_00:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10b85a4e1e42ec11f5ac87d9c5831dddd8fa76e2b975f0fcbd087b48b6ffaac9",
      "text": "噢！看大家都喘口气了，\n制作人，跟我们讲讲正事吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_003_00_5_05_003_00:5_05_003_00:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32fa05b749f1ec4416568bc8baf0378d627083b9c8f6d4d0363259aa1258a514",
      "text": "好的。北斗先生、辉先生、类先生，将作为315 Pro的代表，\n出席一场演唱会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_003_00_5_05_003_00:5_05_003_00:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a5a9520def00331b884bc2c4c674318a26dcc916f27a0b5a0f0f993c61d60e3",
      "text": "聚集了其他事务所偶像的大规模演唱会。\n详细内容在这里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_003_00_5_05_003_00:5_05_003_00:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5b2d3f0dbd6ad84c3f425edd9c63b3667c35f1fd0b64fb26f2b844c1b96780b",
      "text": "还有其他事务所的idol出演吗？\n让人想起JIF呢☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_003_00_5_05_003_00:5_05_003_00:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:265ef6b021ff27d5084bf94fbb692518ce438709f5f5421b13ba1d622eaa2d8c",
      "text": "呵呵，确实呢。希望能像那次一样，\n和天使酱们度过一段美好的时光呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_003_00_5_05_003_00:5_05_003_00:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a74800bb2ae22f9398e1d7741e1324f31eafd8e02bec3c7bbc28b07f319a5e2d",
      "text": "啊啊，而且也不能输给其他事务所啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_003_00_5_05_003_00:5_05_003_00:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28013773e527cdfbc8c702def70fec1a3d81922a23356c8c926565aedeea4b9a",
      "text": "Wow！干劲十足呢！\n我都能看到Mr. 天道背后燃起的fire了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_05_003_00_5_05_003_00:5_05_003_00:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7004f9f9935e5aba10b6a866893118d2704291775c19c0a54f9f2387d19d13df",
      "text": "是的，我们会作为315 Production的代表，\n展现出精彩绝伦的舞台给各位看的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
